```

can transfer to nonzero `m3` operations on cohomology while preserving a common
circle weight and its `Z3` reduction. This is the current concrete model for
simple preprojection rules becoming higher postprojection interactions.

The `H4-T1` upgrade places that transfer inside one nested object. A real
configuration-dependent superconnection satisfies

```text
Q_A(x)^2=(1+x^2)I,
V(x)=1/2(1+x^2)^2,
```

and the same 32-to-24 cyclic contraction intertwines `Q`, its adjoint,
curvature, normalized cost, outer Witten differential, and both Witten-square
